348	싸피레이스 튜토리얼 방송 안내	### 【 싸피레이스 튜토리얼 방송 안내 】 \n \n 안녕하세요. SSAFY사무국 입니다. \n 금일 16시! 14기 싸피레이스 튜토리얼이 진행됩니다. \n 포텐셜 기 마지막 게이미피케이션 알고리즘 경진대회! 모두 기대되시죠? \n즐겁고 적극적으로 따라와 주시기 바랍니다.\n \n 15시 55분까지 YouTube 라이브에 접속해주세요!\n \n튜토리얼 방송 전 사전 시뮬레이터 설치 및 환경 셋팅이 필요합니다. 시뮬레이터 설치와 개발환경 구축까지 완료해주세요! \n\n#### \\[싸피레이스 튜토리얼 영상 링크\\] \n※ 시뮬레이터 설치파일과 영상링크는 Play!SSAFY에서도 확인 가능\n1\\. 시뮬레이터 설치하기 : [바로가기](https://edu.ssafy.com/edu/board/free/detail.do?searchBrdItmCdVal=&brdItmSeq=110291&regUserId=&searchOpenYn=&searchMyItm=&eduGradCd=&searchWord=&_csrf=96de4e6e-08b8-4259-a884-8d72668a7654&pageIndex=2)\n2\\. 파이썬 개발환경 구축하기 : [바로가기](https://edu.ssafy.com/edu/board/free/detail.do?searchBrdItmCdVal=4&brdItmSeq=110383&regUserId=&searchOpenYn=&searchMyItm=&eduGradCd=&searchWord=&_csrf=b1d2b7f2-a562-40fb-a9fa-c8060f10faa2&pageIndex=1)\n3\\. 자바 개발환경 구축하기 : [바로가기](https://edu.ssafy.com/edu/board/free/detail.do?brdItmSeq=110367&listMenu=&lctCd=null&lctrRepId=null&lctrBrdSeq=null&pageIndex=1&searchBrdItmCdVal=4&searchMyItm=&searchOpenYn=&searchWord=&_csrf=b1d2b7f2-a562-40fb-a9fa-c8060f10faa2)\n4\\. C++ 개발환경 구축하기 : [바로가기](https://edu.ssafy.com/edu/board/free/detail.do?brdItmSeq=110368&listMenu=&lctCd=null&lctrRepId=null&lctrBrdSeq=null&pageIndex=1&searchBrdItmCdVal=4&searchMyItm=&searchOpenYn=&searchWord=&_csrf=b1d2b7f2-a562-40fb-a9fa-c8060f10faa2)	2025-12-11 15:42:00.349+09	2025-12-11 16:00:00+09	2025-12-11 17:00:00+09	88	6	[0.01861629,0.028889813,-0.0127882715,-0.04385912,-0.0068053147,-0.0059680585,0.03994994,-0.003608247,-0.0138132395,-0.0185567,0.0014927596,-0.03380013,0.014862045,0.0016625945,0.026720693,-0.0004461891,-0.06302365,-0.026768366,-0.027650315,-0.008342768,0.010196054,-0.04104642,0.0006886508,0.0067695603,0.024599247,-0.02741195,0.012394969,0.0356117,0.028270064,-0.00012905219,0.021214467,-0.035182644,0.0076991827,-0.035850067,-0.010642988,0.015529467,-0.02505214,-0.0007798998,-0.032465287,0.003986651,-0.019760441,-0.037542455,-0.064549185,-0.012585661,0.011727548,0.042691134,-0.028532267